  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 50dffe8bfcb32a54198572825a7c4c8c, type: 2}
  Data:
  - content: "Tr\u1EA7n H\u1EA1o Nam m\xE0y h\u1ED5 b\xE1o l\u1EAFm \xE0? C\xF3 gan
      th\xEC ch\u01A1i v\u1EDBi Qu\u1EA1 \u0110en tao, \u0111\u1EC3 xem T\u1EE9 Nh\u1ECB
      L\u1EE5c c\u1EE7a m\xE0y c\xF3 ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 d\xF9ng ti\u1EC1n mua v\u1EC1
      hay kh\xF4ng?"
    imgCharacter: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 95afcf84258c4df4ebb0f74279cff9d1, type: 3}
  - content: "\u0110\xF4ng Anh b\u1ECDn m\xE0y chuy\u1EC7n x\u1EA5u g\xEC c\u0169ng
      l\xE0m, h\u1EA1i ch\u1EBFt bao anh em H\u1ED3ng H\u01B0ng"
    imgCharacter: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 121610ad7febfb14095cfd9f04938b81, type: 3}
  - content: "H\xF4m nay tao tuy\u1EC7t kh\xF4ng tha cho m\xE0y"
    imgCharacter: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 121610ad7febfb14095cfd9f04938b81, type: 3}
  - content: "D\u1EF1a v\xE0o m\xE0y m\xE0 \u0111\xF2i x\xFAc tao, \u0103n c*t \u0111i"
    imgCharacter: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 95afcf84258c4df4ebb0f74279cff9d1, type: 3}
  itemReward: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5aee603ac393c4bc5b0846b220106b37, type: 2}
